s needed.”","value":"3-all-its-variations-have-the-same-intent-delivering-exactly-the-right-pieces-of-your-private-data-to-an-llm-the-moment-that-data-is-needed","line":435,"column":0,"depth":3},"4-a-knowledge-base-acts-as-an-external-memory-store-for-llms":{"type":"header","text":"4) “A knowledge base acts as an external memory store for LLMs.”","value":"4-a-knowledge-base-acts-as-an-external-memory-store-for-llms","line":445,"column":0,"depth":3},"5-the-goal-is-to-generate-a-prompt-that-contains-the-customers-question-and-only-the-information-the-llm-needs-as-context":{"type":"header","text":"5) “The goal is to generate a prompt that contains the customer’s question and only the information the LLM needs as context.”","value":"5-the-goal-is-to-generate-a-prompt-that-contains-the-customers-question-and-only-the-information-the-llm-needs-as-context","line":466,"column":0,"depth":3},"6-rag-isnt-just-about-adding-documents-to-a-prompt-its-about-shaping-the-context-so-the-model-sees-only-what-matters-in-the-clearest-possible-form":{"type":"header","text":"6) “RAG isn’t just about adding documents to a prompt; it’s about shaping the context so the model sees only what matters, in the clearest possible form.”","value":"6-rag-isnt-just-about-adding-documents-to-a-prompt-its-about-shaping-the-context-so-the-model-sees-only-what-matters-in-the-clearest-possible-form","line":477,"column":0,"depth":3},"7-good-context-engineering-lowers-cost-reduces-hallucinations-and-measurably-improves-answer-quality":{"type":"header","text":"7) “Good context engineering lowers cost, reduces hallucinations, and measurably improves answer quality.”","value":"7-good-context-engineering-lowers-cost-reduces-hallucinations-and-measurably-improves-answer-quality","line":500,"column":0,"depth":3},"8-the-pipeline-in-rag-is-simply-the-end-to-end-flow-that-takes-your-raw-data-and-turns-it-into-an-llm-powered-answer":{"type":"header","text":"8) “The pipeline in RAG is simply the end-to-end flow that takes your raw data and turns it into an LLM-powered answer.”","value":"8-the-pipeline-in-rag-is-simply-the-end-to-end-flow-that-takes-your-raw-data-and-turns-it-into-an-llm-powered-answer","line":512,"column":0,"depth":3},"9-choosing-a-good-text-chunking-strategy-is-key-to-building-a-reliable-rag-solution":{"type":"header","text":"9) “Choosing a good text-chunking strategy is key to building a reliable RAG solution.”","value":"9-choosing-a-good-text-chunking-strategy-is-key-to-building-a-reliable-rag-solution","line":533,"column":0,"depth":3},"10-users-dont-and-shouldnt-trust-a-response-just-because-it-sounds-confident-they-trust-evidence":{"type":"header","text":"10) “Users don’t, and shouldn’t, trust a response just because it sounds confident. They trust evidence.”","value":"10-users-dont-and-shouldnt-trust-a-response-just-because-it-sounds-confident-they-trust-evidence","line":541,"column":0,"depth":3},"11-naive-rag--is-simple-it-works-and-its-perfect-for-getting-started-but-as-your-needs-grow-you-might-hit-its-limits":{"type":"header","text":"11) “Naive RAG ... is simple, it works, and it’s perfect for getting started. But as your needs grow, you might hit its limits.”","value":"11-naive-rag--is-simple-it-works-and-its-perfect-for-getting-started-but-as-your-needs-grow-you-might-hit-its-limits","line":547,"column":0,"depth":3},"12-every-rag-variant--simply-tweaks-one-or-more-of-these-pipeline-stages":{"type":"header","text":"12) “Every RAG variant ... simply tweaks one or more of these pipeline stages...”","value":"12-every-rag-variant--simply-tweaks-one-or-more-of-these-pipeline-stages","line":553,"column":0,"depth":3},"13-in-practice-productionizing-a-rag-solution-is-about-tightening-every-component-in-the-pipeline-so-answers-are-relevant-trustworthy-and-production-grade":{"type":"header","text":"13) “In practice, ‘productionizing’ a RAG solution is about tightening every component in the pipeline so answers are relevant, trustworthy, and production grade.”","value":"13-in-practice-productionizing-a-rag-solution-is-about-tightening-every-component-in-the-pipeline-so-answers-are-relevant-trustworthy-and-production-grade","line":574,"column":0,"depth":3},"sintesis-kutipan-chapter-8":{"type":"header","text":"Sintesis kutipan Chapter 8","value":"sintesis-kutipan-chapter-8","line":582,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-author-penting-untuk-dibahas":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa author penting untuk dibahas","value":"kenapa-author-penting-untuk-dibahas","line":588,"column":0,"depth":2},"siapa-yang-paling-memengaruhi-tone":{"type":"header","text":"Siapa yang paling memengaruhi tone?","value":"siapa-yang-paling-memengaruhi-tone","line":598,"column":0,"depth":3},"insight-penting-dari-analisis-author":{"type":"header","text":"Insight penting dari analisis author","value":"insight-penting-dari-analisis-author","line":608,"column":0,"depth":3}},"children":[],"parent":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","data":{}}
